                    briefing_title_r1:      `Round 1 — Diagnose the missing institutions, not the missing campaign`,
                    briefing_text_r1:       `The dossier is in front of you: the flagship halted, three rival proto-standards, and the positions of manufacturers, ~30 developers, two insurers, three lenders and a watchful regulator. The technology already works and developers already believe in it — so why doesn't the market exist? Resist behaving like a product company that <em>"just promotes the timber"</em>. Using Ventresca's systems-change lens, name the <strong>binding institutional gap</strong>: with <strong>no shared, insurer-accepted standard</strong>, risk cannot be priced, so insurers won't underwrite and lenders won't finance. That gap — not awareness or technology — stopped your flagship three weeks before completion.`,
                    briefing_title_r2:      `Round 2 — Choose the gap to fill first & sequence the intervention`,
